  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono Besaleli ne Oholiabu, ne bakholi babaandi boosi nibo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia sinani ne bukesi khumanya khukhola kimilimo khu Lukaangu, balakhola khuloondekhana nende koosi niko Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alakile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bareera biianwa Bikali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa alaanga Besaleli ne Oholiabu, alala ne bakholi babaandi boosi banyala, nibo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aelesia sinani lundi ba baaba ne kumwoyo kwe khuyeeta, beeche bakhole kimilimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banyoola khukhwama khu Musa biianwa bie khukhwerusia bioosi nibio Baisiraeli bareera khulwe khukhwombakhila Abuundu Atakatifu. Ne babaandu ba Isiraeli bachiililila khureerera Musa biianwa bie khukhwerusia buli kumutikhinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bakholi be sinani boosi ba baaba ne balikho bakhola kumulimo bacha barura buli mundu khukhwama khu mulimo nikwo aba ne alikho akhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne baboolela Musa bali, “Babaandu balareeranga khutuumia sikelo sisienyekhana khulwe kumulimo nikwo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alaka khukhola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono Musa aaana lilaka, mala likhuwa lialaangililwa mu kambi lili, “Mbao omundu owe siseecha namwe owe siikhasi yesi yesi ocha khuaana lundi khulwe liiema litakatifu tawe.” Nio babaandu bakhiingililwa khuaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaba kario sikila bibiindu nibio bakholi be mu liiema litakatifu baba ne nabio biaba bioola khukhola kimilimo kioosi mala bisikale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhola liiema lie kumuse",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu boosi ba banyala, bakhola liiema litakatifu. Balikhola khulwe khurumikhira chipasia ekhumi. Chipasia echo chaba chanabwa khukhwama khu ngubo eya katani eyanabwa bulayi ne buusi bubuusi, bunapeenda, bubesemu mala chanabwakho ekerubi mungila eye busicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buleeyi bwa buli epasia bwaba bikele kamakhumi kabili na munaane ne bukhiikha bikele bine. Chipasia choosi chaba chindekhaane buleeyi ne bukhiikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banabila alala chipasia chiraano ne chichiindi chiraano bachinabila alala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola chimbete chimbuusi khu likemo lie epasia eye enje khu buli sipupu sie chipasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola chimbete kamakhumi karaano khu pasia chiraano che khunyoa ne chimbete kamakhumi karaano bachibotookhelesia khu pasia che khabili. Chimbete echo chaloleelelana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola chingaki che esahabu kamakhumi karaano, nicho baambanisilia chipasia bipupu bibili, buli sipupu khu sindi nio liiema litakatifu liaba busa lilala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bakhola chipasia khukhwama khu bufuumbo bwe chimbusi, khulwe sifuunikho sie liiema litakatifu. Choosi alala chaba chipasia ekhumi na ndala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buleeyi bwa buli epasia bwaba bikele kamakhumi kataru ne bukhiikha bikele bine. Chipasia ekhumi na ndala echo choosi chaba chilekhaana, buleeyi ne bukhiikha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banabila alala chipasia chiraano. Lundi chichiindi sita bachinabila alala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banabila chimbete kamakhumi karaano khu likemo lie epasia eye enje eye chipasia che khunyoa ne chimbete kamakhumi karaano bachinabila khu likemo lie enje lie chipasia che khabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne akhola chingaki kamakhumi karaano che kumukasa khuambanisilia alala liiema litakatifu nio libe lilala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akholela liiema sifuunikho sie kamasieelo kamabesemu ke kamamiiku ne ke chimbusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio akhola kimitalaachi nikio emia khukhwama khu murongooro kumunyaali khulwe liiema litakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kumutalaachi kwaba buleeyi bikele likhumi ne bukhiikha sikele silala ne enusu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli kumutalaachi kwaba ne biaambaania bibili khulwe khuambaania alala. Aakhola ario khu mitalaachi kioosi kie liiema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyino niyo engila niyo bakholelamo kimitalaachi kie liiema litakatifu: kimitalaachi kamakhumi kabili kialoleelela lubeka lwe ebunafubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne akhola bibale kamakhumi kane bie efwesa asi we kimitalaachi kamakhumi kabili. Bibale bibili biaba asi we kumutalaachi mulala khulwe khutiililila biaambaania bibili. Ne bibale bibiindi bibili biaba asi we kumutalaachi kukuundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola kimitalaachi kamakhumi kabili lubeka lwe ebunaswa we liiema litakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimitalaachi kiaba ne bibale biakio kamakhumi kane bie efwesa. Biabao bibale bibili asi owa buli kumutalaachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwe enyuma we liiema litakatifu, lubeka lwe mumbo balikholela kimitalaachi sita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola kimitalaachi kibili khulwe chikhuumbo che liiema litakatifu enyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimitalaachi kie mu khuumbo kino kiakabukhanamo asi ne kakhali kiaambaana kiombi mu mukhono kwe khunyoa khucha angaaki. Nono bakhola kimitalaachi kibili khulwe chikoona chibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako kiabao kimitalaachi munaane ne bibale biakio bie efwesa. Biaba bibale likhumi na sita, bibale bibili asi owa buli kumutalaachi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola kimilapa kie kimirongooro kiminyaali, kiraano khulwe kimitalaachi kiili khu lubeka lulala lwe liiema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiraano khulwe kimitalaachi kie lubeka luluundi lwe liiema, ne kiraano luundi khulwe kimitalaachi kie enyuma, lubeka lwe mumbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhola kumulapa kwe akari kwabira khukhwama khu ndulo khulala khwe liiema litakatifu khukhwola khu luundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bafuunikha kimitalaachi ne esahabu mala barakho kamakhono ke esahabu khulwe khutiila kimilapa. Akhaba kimilapa kiosi kiafuunikhwa ne esahabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
